OL,3,ACan Trump really pay $5,000 to every
OL,4,AAmerican adult?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US president has given no details
OL,7,Fon how it would be funded, though US
OL,8,FVice-President JD Vance suggested it
OL,9,Fmight be paid for by tariff revenue and
OL,10,Fthat such cheques would not go to
OL,11,Fwealthy Americans.
